==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start by upgrading your [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies get close to your base, send out a couple of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]]. Just wait for your money to go up, and when Sir Seal and Gory appear, start spamming meatshields, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]]. When you kill them, Jackie Peng should be no problem. After that, send out [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] and you will be good to go.

