==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Ibaraki Prefecture'''.
*Argentina's base is [[wikipedia:Diego Maradona|Diego Maradona]], a legendary football player and manager.
*Ibaraki Prefecture's base and [[Treasure]] are [[wikipedia:Nattō|''nattō'']], the fermented soybeans for which Ibaraki and especially the city of Mito are famous.

